# Module order for the game build = memory order of the final image.
# tools/build_elite.py concatenates these into build/elite.mac and
# assembles the result with bin/macro11.  Paths are repo-relative;
# build/ entries are generated during the build.
#
# A generated table has to come BEFORE any module that sizes a buffer
# from one of its symbols: .BLKW needs its count in pass one, so a
# forward reference there silently derails the location counter and
# every later label reports as an illegal symbol definition.
#
# RT_ENTRY begins at 001000; RT-11 owns the low page. PPU modules must
# remain contiguous and position independent. tail.mac reuses their dead
# CPU copy after upload, and ends the SAV with RT_ENTRY as transfer address.
